 "description": "The YubiKey 5 cryptographic module is a secure element that supports multiple protocols designed to be embedded in USB and/or NFC security tokens. The module can generate, store, and perform cryptographic operations for sensitive data and can be utilized via an external touch-button for Test of User Presence. The module implements several major functions - Yubico One Time Password (OTP), FIDO/FIDO2, FIDO/U2F, PIV-compatible smart card, OpenPGP smart card, and OATH OTP authentication.",
